{"id":"19a4cf094048e2b4","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornleastfalse.md","title":"Least false point of a nonconstant-one Horn function","display":"thm-hornleastfalse — Least false point of a nonconstant-one Horn function","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornleastfalse","aliases":["27-thm-hornleastfalse"],"display":"thm-hornleastfalse — Least false point of a nonconstant-one Horn function","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornleastfalse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornleastfalse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornleastfalse — Least false point of a nonconstant-one Horn function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\preceq b\">\\(a\\preceq b\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}\">\\(\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}\\)</span> for nonempty <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left(F(f)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\left(\\bigwedge F(f)\\in F(f)\\land\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(\\bigwedge F(f)\\preceq a)\\land\\exists!b\\in F(f)\\;\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(b\\preceq a)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left(F(f)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\left(\\bigwedge F(f)\\in F(f)\\land\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(\\bigwedge F(f)\\preceq a)\\land\\exists!b\\in F(f)\\;\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(b\\preceq a)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Corollary 6.3，印刷页 279，PDF 第 303 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对完整证明：非空假点集有限且交闭，因此全体交仍是假点并小于等于每个假点。必须排除恒一函数，因为其假点集为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F(f)$ is defined in [[27-df-truefalse]]; $\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}$ for nonempty $R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$; $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F(f)$ is defined in [[27-df-truefalse]]; $\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}$ for nonempty $R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$; $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\preceq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\left(F(f)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\left(\\bigwedge F(f)\\in F(f)\\land\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(\\bigwedge F(f)\\preceq a)\\land\\exists!b\\in F(f)\\;\\forall a\\in F(f)\\;(b\\preceq a)\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1421,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-438","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornleastfalse|thm-hornleastfalse — Least false point of a nonconstant-one Horn function]]"}],"outgoing":["bb96ce122f7cd0ef","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","584eb5a4dd07e7fb","5d10aed668d85817"]}